\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b0/Font_TeamMeat_t.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822061104\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"i\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat i.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_i.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b0/Font_TeamMeat_i.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060636\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"c\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat c.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_c.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/45/Font_TeamMeat_c.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060413\" /></span></span></span></div></div></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity Image</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Entity image\"><img alt=\"Entity image\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"105\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Fanatic.png\" data-image-key=\"Fanatic.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/ff/Fanatic.png/revision/latest?cb=20210824114813\" /></span></span></div></div><br /></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-smart-group pi-border-color\">\n    \n        <section class=\"pi-smart-group-head pi-border-color\">\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\">Base HP</h3>\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\">Stage HP</h3>\n            \n        </section>\n    \n    <section class=\"pi-smart-group-body pi-border-color\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">35</span></div></div></div>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">0</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>832.1</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mausoleum\" title=\"Mausoleum\"><img alt=\"Stage Mausoleum icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mausoleum icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mausoleum_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/80/Stage_Mausoleum_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172400\" /></a></span><br />During the fight with &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Heretic\" title=\"The Heretic\"><img alt=\"Boss The Heretic ingame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss The Heretic ingame.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_The_Heretic_ingame.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b5/Boss_The_Heretic_ingame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210824124036\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Heretic\" title=\"The Heretic\">The Heretic</a></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p>The <b>Fanatic</b> is a variant of Exorcists, encountered only at the start of the fight with &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Heretic\" title=\"The Heretic\"><img alt=\"Boss The Heretic ingame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss The Heretic ingame.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_The_Heretic_ingame.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b5/Boss_The_Heretic_ingame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210824124036\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Heretic\" title=\"The Heretic\">The Heretic</a>.\n</p><p>At the beginning a group of 5 Exorcists are seen on the edges of a large purple pentagram on the floor, chanting and kneeling towards the center as The Heretic emerges. They are shielded until after The Heretic is fully summoned, after which they transform into Fanatics (which appear to be Exorcists with the skull replaced by a purple flame) and begin behave similarly to &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faceless\" title=\"Faceless\"><img alt=\"Faceless\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Faceless.png\" data-image-key=\"Faceless.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f5/Faceless.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210407202752\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Faceless\" title=\"Faceless\">Faceless</a>, chasing Isaac while occasionally shooting two purple, rotating tears as it does so, like a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trite#Ragling\" title=\"Trite\"><img alt=\"Ragling\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Ragling.png\" data-image-key=\"Ragling.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/91/Ragling.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825033709\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Trite#Ragling\" title=\"Trite\">Ragling</a>.\n</p><p>Upon death, they have a chance to turn into &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pacer\" title=\"Pacer\"><img alt=\"Pacer\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Pacer.png\" data-image-key=\"Pacer.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/0c/Pacer.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821090428\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pacer\" title=\"Pacer\">Pacers</a> or &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pacer#Gusher\" title=\"Pacer\"><img alt=\"Gusher\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gusher.png\" data-image-key=\"Gusher.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/bf/Gusher.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/18?cb=20210821085825\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pacer#Gusher\" title=\"Pacer\">Gushers</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://antibirth.fandom.com/wiki/Exorcist\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"anti:Exorcist\">Exorcists</a> are from the <i>Antibirth</i> mod where they were a common enemy in <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mausoleum\" title=\"Mausoleum\"><img alt=\"Mausoleum\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mausoleum icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mausoleum_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/80/Stage_Mausoleum_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825172400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mausoleum\" title=\"Mausoleum\">Mausoleum</a>.\n<ul><li>They could also spawn &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wizoob\" title=\"Wizoob\"><img alt=\"Wizoob\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wizoob.png\" data-image-key=\"Wizoob.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b3/Wizoob.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/17?cb=20210825033200\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wizoob\" title=\"Wizoob\">Wizoobs</a> and &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Candler\" title=\"Candler\"><img alt=\"Candler\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"14\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Candler.png\" data-image-key=\"Candler.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b1/Candler.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/14?cb=20210407194629\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Candler\" title=\"Candler\">Candlers</a> in conjunction with Lil' Haunts.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no